	"hardwareControls": [
		"27-key button keyboard",
		"16 step buttons",
		"15 control knobs",
		"Value encoder"
	],
	"notice": "Connect the 5-pin DIN MIDI sockets through a MIDI interface; this model has no USB MIDI connection. Configure the track MIDI channels and clock source to match the other gear. The keyboard, step keys and knobs change behavior with the selected track, mode and overlay, so no fixed note or CC assignments are supplied. Power is from AA batteries or a suitable DC adapter. Exact browser MIDI port aliases have not been verified; select this profile manually. DIN-connected hardware appears under the MIDI interface name. Physical controls are unbound and this profile does not supply a complete MIDI implementation. Diagrams show selected physical controls with illustrative positions; consult the linked manufacturer references for the full panel.",
